PAGER(1)                    User Commands                   PAGER(1)

NAME
    pager - browse text one screen at a time

SYNOPSIS
    pager [file...]

DESCRIPTION
    pager reads files or standard input into memory and displays a full-screen
    view. Piped input can therefore be searched and revisited.

KEYS
    Space or f   move forward one page
    b            move backward one page
    Enter or j   move forward one line
    k            move backward one line
    g, G         move to the beginning or final page
    /text        search forward
    n            repeat the search
    h            show key help
    q            quit

SEE ALSO
    man(1), more(1)
